WEBVTT

00:02.440 --> 00:05.560
I need to score better
outside of classic lit...

00:05.560 --> 00:08.150
I can't get a medical excuse for the quiz.

00:08.150 --> 00:10.700
No one gets a medical excuse for a quiz.

00:11.200 --> 00:13.890
Oh, studying around the kotatsu, are we?

00:14.230 --> 00:15.740
We have exams coming up.

00:15.740 --> 00:18.550
Nice! How about I join you—

00:18.550 --> 00:19.470
Go away.

00:20.820 --> 00:23.210
We don't have a place for you, Kyosuke.

00:23.210 --> 00:24.250
Huh?

00:24.250 --> 00:27.070
Just Sota, me, Miyamura, and Mom.

00:27.070 --> 00:28.260
Hey...

00:28.260 --> 00:31.330
Are you treating me worse by the day?

00:31.330 --> 00:32.170
I might just cry.

02:03.540 --> 02:06.650
<i>I swear my wife uses this
language wrong sometimes.</i>

02:06.650 --> 02:08.250
<i>Oh? How so?</i>

02:08.250 --> 02:10.820
<i>I was super depressed...</i>

02:10.820 --> 02:13.360
<i>so my wife cooked a meal to cheer me up.</i>

02:13.360 --> 02:14.980
<i>She sounds like a great wife.</i>

02:14.980 --> 02:18.070
<i>She grabbed my shoulder
and said with a serious face...</i>

02:15.320 --> 02:19.660
<b>Hori Kotatsu</b>

02:18.070 --> 02:21.990
<i>"A-A journey of a thousand miles
begins with fifty to a hundred steps..."</i>

02:26.090 --> 02:27.250
Bathroom...

02:34.250 --> 02:36.430
Ow...

02:36.430 --> 02:38.260
What are you doing?

02:38.260 --> 02:39.430
What time is it?

02:40.560 --> 02:43.570
Hori-san, wait, wait, wait! 
Don't get up! Lie back down!

02:43.570 --> 02:44.180
Huh?

02:44.180 --> 02:45.260
Yeowch!

02:45.260 --> 02:46.920
My leg! My leg! My leg! My leg! My leg!

02:46.390 --> 02:53.270
CRAMPED

02:46.920 --> 02:47.770
Your leg?

02:47.770 --> 02:51.230
I mean, someone's leg is locking 
 my knee and I can't get up!

02:51.230 --> 02:53.270
It's not mine.

02:51.980 --> 02:53.270
<b>*It's hers</b>

02:53.270 --> 02:57.090
Aw, man... I just want to go to the bathroom.

02:57.090 --> 02:58.360
Just do it there.

02:58.360 --> 03:00.280
Don't be unreasonable!

03:01.650 --> 03:03.830
Huh? What time is it?

03:03.830 --> 03:05.080
Around ten or so?

03:05.080 --> 03:06.620
Ouch!

03:06.620 --> 03:07.770
Keep it down, Kyoko.

03:07.770 --> 03:10.200
You're twisting my leg when you move!

03:10.200 --> 03:12.520
That's ridiculous. Right, Miyamura-kun?

03:12.520 --> 03:15.090
Wait, Miyamura-kun? What's wrong?

03:15.090 --> 03:16.800
I need to go to the bathroom...

03:17.140 --> 03:21.580
<i>I know. I'll wake up Sota. 
He'll catch cold if he sleeps here.</i>

03:21.580 --> 03:22.870
Sota...

03:24.430 --> 03:26.620
You're wrenching my leg, Miyamura-kun!

03:26.620 --> 03:29.470
Stop moving, Kyosuke!

03:30.470 --> 03:33.440
<i>A cruel world where we all harm each other...</i>

03:33.690 --> 03:35.550
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow...

03:34.250 --> 03:36.420
What now? Should we call for help?

03:36.420 --> 03:41.340
That'd be too embarrassing. We're entangled
 like something out of a pervy book.

03:41.340 --> 03:42.560
Right, Miyamura-kun?

03:42.560 --> 03:43.820
Ouch!

03:43.820 --> 03:47.330
You get out, Kyosuke! It's your 
fault this is so complicated!

03:45.200 --> 03:47.330
<b>Hori</b>

03:45.200 --> 03:47.330
<b>Dad</b>

03:45.200 --> 03:47.330
<b>Miyamura</b>

03:47.330 --> 03:50.330
What was that? I'd get out if I could.

03:50.330 --> 03:54.450
I can't take this anymore. 
I need to go so bad I can't even get up.

03:54.450 --> 03:55.570
You two figure it out.

03:55.570 --> 03:57.100
Don't give up, Miyamura!

03:57.930 --> 03:59.540
Let's review the situation.

03:59.540 --> 04:01.490
We need a plan. Someone must be sacrificed.

04:01.490 --> 04:04.160
Okay, I'll pull as hard as I can.

04:04.160 --> 04:05.340
Please wait.

04:05.860 --> 04:09.980
Kyosuke-san's right leg
is stuck between mine.

04:09.980 --> 04:13.100
Hori-san's legs are also wrapped
pretty tightly around me.

04:13.100 --> 04:15.350
Pulling will cause lots of pain 
but ultimately fail.

04:15.350 --> 04:16.330
I see.

04:16.330 --> 04:18.110
So what do we do?

04:18.660 --> 04:21.270
I'll yank as hard as I can, 
so you two bear with it!

04:21.270 --> 04:22.610
Hold it right there!

04:22.610 --> 04:25.080
What kind of idiotic idea is that?!

04:25.080 --> 04:28.120
Then answer me this! Does anyone
need the bathroom more than me?

04:28.120 --> 04:32.420
And what about me?! My skirt's flipped, 
but I'm not complaining!

04:32.420 --> 04:34.830
That's not the same thing! 
No one can even see it!

04:35.460 --> 04:37.630
Don't go back to sleep, Kyosuke!

04:35.580 --> 04:37.630
<b>Disengaged</b>

04:38.880 --> 04:40.950
I shouldn't have drunk so much tea.

04:40.950 --> 04:42.130
Man...

04:43.630 --> 04:44.840
Wait, hang on.

04:47.340 --> 04:49.690
I did it! One of my legs is free!

04:49.690 --> 04:51.100
Really? That's great!

04:52.200 --> 04:53.600
One of mine is free, too!

04:53.600 --> 04:55.230
Kyosuke, wake up!

04:55.620 --> 04:56.620
Huh?

04:56.620 --> 04:58.000
All right, I'm out!

05:02.740 --> 05:05.240
Did Miyamura-kun make it in time?

05:05.700 --> 05:08.320
<i>I'm glad that crisis is over.</i>

05:11.030 --> 05:12.370
I've got it.

05:12.370 --> 05:15.560
Instead of lying down in
 three different directions,

05:12.410 --> 05:19.130
<b>Hori</b>

05:12.410 --> 05:19.130
<b>Dad</b>

05:12.410 --> 05:19.130
<b>Miyamura</b>

05:15.160 --> 05:19.130
<b>Dad\h\h\hHori\h\hMiyamura</b>

05:15.560 --> 05:17.600
we can all do it the same way.

05:18.000 --> 05:19.130
Good thinking.

05:19.170 --> 05:22.880
<b>They all slept in the kotatsu.</b>

05:25.470 --> 05:28.530
When I woke up last time,
 it was already dark.

05:28.530 --> 05:30.640
I'll go home at seven today.

05:31.040 --> 05:32.820
That gives us about an hour.

05:32.820 --> 05:35.310
Crap. I might fall asleep.

05:35.310 --> 05:37.220
Oh, don't be silly.

05:46.380 --> 05:49.320
Hey, aren't you Sengoku's boy?

05:51.060 --> 05:55.190
Do you remember me? 
You used to come to our house to play.

05:55.190 --> 05:58.120
Y-Yes, you're Kyo-chan's...

06:00.570 --> 06:02.370
Boy, you sure grew a lot.

06:02.370 --> 06:05.540
No wonder, given you're Kyoko's age.

06:07.270 --> 06:10.620
Man, that takes me back
to my high school days...

06:08.050 --> 06:09.290
Listen to me, Kakeru.

06:09.290 --> 06:12.290
The Horis are trouble. The parents 
have been since high school.

06:12.290 --> 06:15.730
You have to hold your ground! Let them
lead you by the nose and you're in for it!

06:15.730 --> 06:17.480
In for what?

06:17.480 --> 06:19.570
Trouble with a capital T!

06:19.570 --> 06:23.070
So, Kake... Uh, T-Takeru-kun, 
how's your dad doing?

06:23.070 --> 06:26.490
My name's Kakeru! 
My dad is doing well, thank you.

06:27.260 --> 06:30.290
Oh? He is, is he?

06:30.710 --> 06:32.990
<i>He's going to do something to my dad!</i>

06:33.340 --> 06:37.400
Excuse me. I was just 
on my way to buy an eraser...

06:38.000 --> 06:41.310
Since you're here, why not stop by our place?

06:41.310 --> 06:44.140
It's cold. Come in and warm up.

06:42.690 --> 06:44.630
No, wait... I...

06:57.110 --> 06:58.850
Hey. Hey, old man.

06:58.850 --> 07:01.770
What? I just fell asleep.

07:02.320 --> 07:04.740
When did Sengoku get here? And how?

07:04.740 --> 07:08.730
Around nine. I ran into him 
outside and invited him in.

07:08.730 --> 07:13.280
Then while we were talking,
 I started getting real sleepy.

07:13.280 --> 07:15.840
Miyamura, it's midnight.

07:18.840 --> 07:22.480
Gotta save... before the dungeon...

07:22.480 --> 07:23.290
Huh?

07:23.690 --> 07:27.770
Right, President...?
Can't forget to save, can you...?

07:27.770 --> 07:32.630
Oh, yeah, and buy some 
MP recovery items in town...

07:32.630 --> 07:33.300
Yeah...

07:34.200 --> 07:36.180
Encounter! Encounter!

07:37.310 --> 07:39.710
A g-golem appeared!

07:39.710 --> 07:41.560
Huh? Why are you looking at <i>me</i>?

07:41.560 --> 07:44.620
Calm down, President!
 I'll cast a destruction spell!

07:44.620 --> 07:46.110
You calm down first!

07:46.110 --> 07:48.230
Great! The hero's party is here!

07:48.230 --> 07:49.570
You stay out of this!

07:49.910 --> 07:52.440
Wait, what's the president doing here?

07:52.440 --> 07:54.360
I was abducted in my own neighborhood.

07:54.360 --> 07:55.950
His doing, I'll bet.

07:56.630 --> 08:00.670
I haven't had a bath or eaten 
dinner, and I took a long nap.

08:00.670 --> 08:02.650
Oh, yeah, wouldn't wanna miss my bath.

08:02.650 --> 08:05.750
Just use ours and quit whining, you two.

08:05.750 --> 08:08.710
Huh? But I can't show him.

08:08.710 --> 08:11.180
There's something you don't want me to see?

08:11.180 --> 08:12.090
Nope, nothing!

08:14.380 --> 08:19.090
Hey, that's right! You waited until late
 at night to use the bath on our field trip!

08:19.090 --> 08:20.610
D-Did I?

08:20.610 --> 08:24.100
You wouldn't get in the pool, either.
 I was wondering why that was.

08:24.450 --> 08:27.510
Well, y'know, I'm just so scrawny.

08:29.170 --> 08:32.360
If <i>you're</i> scrawny, 
I might as well be a skeleton.

08:34.650 --> 08:37.620
Th-Th-That wasn't supposed to be funny!

08:49.750 --> 08:50.250
3 unread messages

08:50.250 --> 08:51.530
Where are you?

09:01.680 --> 09:04.770
I did it again...

09:04.770 --> 09:06.770
This kotatsu's bad news.

09:06.770 --> 09:08.190
Miyamura, wake up—

09:08.980 --> 09:11.480
3 unread messages

09:08.980 --> 09:11.480
Man, he left his phone open.

09:12.150 --> 09:13.490
You've got messages—

09:17.610 --> 09:20.280
Oh, crap. I sent those to Miyamura.

09:20.280 --> 09:22.620
So that's why Chika hasn't shown.

09:22.620 --> 09:26.050
<i>"Where are you? I know it's cold and all,
 but I'd like to apologize for the other day."</i>

09:26.050 --> 09:28.520
<i>"Can you come to the park near school?
I'll be waiting there."</i>

09:28.520 --> 09:31.910
<i>"You can say whatever you like. I'll still 
love you, even though I don't say it much."</i>

09:31.910 --> 09:33.130
<i>"I know you'll understand—"</i>

09:34.880 --> 09:36.680
<i>"Love you"?!</i>

09:38.250 --> 09:40.220
Miyamura! Hey, Miyamura!

09:42.390 --> 09:45.140
What do you want, Shindo?

09:45.140 --> 09:46.270
Ow!

09:48.150 --> 09:49.260
<i>Huh?</i>

09:48.150 --> 09:53.030
<b>Sting\h\h\h\h\h\hSting
Sting</b>

09:49.260 --> 09:53.410
<i>I feel like someone punched me 
in the head as hard as they could.</i>

09:53.410 --> 09:55.650
<i>That can't be, can it? Of course not.</i>

09:57.890 --> 10:00.330
Hori-san, are you asleep?

10:01.760 --> 10:03.480
Oh, you're awake.

10:03.480 --> 10:05.910
Just faking it, huh? It's eight o'clock.

10:05.910 --> 10:07.810
I know that.

10:07.810 --> 10:10.230
Why are you angry?

10:10.620 --> 10:12.220
The cause is a mystery...

10:11.500 --> 10:12.920
<b>It's him</b>

10:13.250 --> 10:14.630
I'm not angry.

10:14.630 --> 10:15.510
Really?

10:15.510 --> 10:17.420
I just said I wasn't.

10:18.890 --> 10:19.930
Hey, lookee here.

10:20.350 --> 10:23.390
We've got mikans, your favorite.

10:23.390 --> 10:25.190
I'll peel one for you.

10:33.820 --> 10:37.400
<i>Wow, she actually got up for that.</i>

10:37.400 --> 10:38.700
<i>Better not laugh, Izumi.</i>

10:40.170 --> 10:43.710
I decided I'd only eat two a day!

10:43.710 --> 10:45.880
So you hate mikans now?

10:45.880 --> 10:47.670
I don't like mikan-flavored things.

10:47.670 --> 10:50.920
Same with yuzu, citron, and grapefruit.

10:51.210 --> 10:54.080
I don't want it!

10:54.080 --> 10:56.710
What? But I just peeled it for you.

10:56.710 --> 10:57.740
Here.

10:58.130 --> 10:59.010
Get it away!

10:59.010 --> 11:00.850
Here. Here, here. Here.

11:02.360 --> 11:04.310
If you don't eat it, I'll kiss you.

11:07.070 --> 11:08.750
And I'll kiss you if you do eat it.

11:15.760 --> 11:18.590
Thank goodness you're not angry anymore.

11:19.020 --> 11:21.210
<i>Is that what he's been up to?</i>

11:22.610 --> 11:23.920
Hey, that message—

11:32.570 --> 11:35.020
<i>Why did he give it to me like that?</i>

11:36.200 --> 11:37.160
<i>Is it habit?</i>

11:38.860 --> 11:40.300
Want a candy?

11:42.870 --> 11:43.890
<i>Is it?!</i>

11:46.770 --> 11:48.320
I won't stand for that.

11:48.700 --> 11:51.210
<i>Here we go again.</i>

11:56.080 --> 11:57.980
That was our elementary camp trip.

11:58.380 --> 12:01.500
I didn't expect to find pictures 
like this at Sengoku's house.

12:01.500 --> 12:03.490
We've been friends a long time, after all.

12:03.890 --> 12:06.450
Sengoku, you haven't changed one bit.

12:06.450 --> 12:09.240
Oh? Y-You think so?

12:09.740 --> 12:13.050
Huh? President, what album is that? 
What pictures are in it?

12:13.050 --> 12:16.500
O-Oh, it's nothing special.
Just some boring ones—

12:17.040 --> 12:18.650
What's in there, Miyamura? Well?

12:18.650 --> 12:20.110
Miyamura-kun, let's play some games!

12:20.110 --> 12:22.150
We still have a Super Nintendo!

12:22.150 --> 12:24.130
You wanted to play it, remember?!

12:22.510 --> 12:23.150
Christmas with Kyoko-chan

12:22.510 --> 12:23.150
Elementary school graduation, at the front door
Congratulations!

12:23.260 --> 12:26.010
Entering middle school, smiling with friend

12:27.040 --> 12:29.580
It says, "Sengoku, age 12,
 screws up cutting his hair."

12:29.580 --> 12:31.680
I wanna see! Pass it here, Miyamura!

12:31.680 --> 12:34.340
No! You're killing me!

12:32.770 --> 12:34.940
Man, this is hilarious.

12:34.340 --> 12:36.270
Give it up, Sengoku!

12:36.270 --> 12:38.270
Kyoko-chan and Kakeru swimming in the kiddie pool

12:36.660 --> 12:38.270
Not a chance!

12:43.660 --> 12:44.380
Lolicon.

12:44.380 --> 12:46.030
N-No!

12:46.310 --> 12:50.530
So, Miyamura, if three is as low as you go,
what's your upper limit?

12:50.530 --> 12:53.540
I don't do less than high school age,
thank you very much.

12:54.880 --> 12:58.040
Does Kyo-chan still get changed
 in front of other people?

13:01.550 --> 13:04.590
Do <i>any</i> girls change 
in front of other people?

13:04.590 --> 13:05.600
She's a third-year.

13:05.600 --> 13:09.110
What? I mean, just the other day, she...

13:07.590 --> 13:12.060
<b>Student Council</b>

13:10.420 --> 13:12.060
I have phys ed first period!

13:12.060 --> 13:14.770
Sengoku, let me borrow
 this room for five minutes.

13:14.770 --> 13:15.950
Sure.

13:15.950 --> 13:18.480
I don't have time to go to the changing room.

13:19.100 --> 13:20.070
Kyo-chan.

13:20.640 --> 13:23.250
Doesn't this make you self-conscious?

13:23.250 --> 13:24.570
I'm still in the room.

13:24.570 --> 13:25.930
Huh?

13:25.930 --> 13:29.960
So what? I could still use the toilet
or the bath with you in the room.

13:30.410 --> 13:31.580
Why do you ask?

13:31.580 --> 13:34.810
<i>She doesn't see it as a big deal at all!</i>

13:34.810 --> 13:39.080
I thought it was a bit odd, so I asked
 if the same went for Miyamura-kun.

13:40.200 --> 13:41.340
And she said...

13:41.870 --> 13:44.080
I'd never do that!

13:44.750 --> 13:46.200
She seemed angry.

13:46.200 --> 13:49.440
I-I see. Sorry, I guess.

13:49.440 --> 13:53.100
We took baths together all the time as kids.

13:53.520 --> 13:55.550
Well, as kids, sure.

13:56.600 --> 13:59.780
Hang on. When was the last time we did it...?

14:00.330 --> 14:01.330
Huh?

14:02.450 --> 14:06.060
<i>I feel like we did it for an 
inappropriately long time...</i>

14:06.060 --> 14:07.960
<i>But I'm afraid to try to remember.</i>

14:07.960 --> 14:09.360
Kindergarten or so?

14:09.690 --> 14:12.920
Oh, yeah. Maybe first grade at the latest.

14:12.920 --> 14:14.120
<i>I need to keep quiet!</i>

14:14.120 --> 14:15.200
Figures.

14:17.620 --> 14:21.270
Crispy

14:17.620 --> 14:21.270
Nori Balls

14:17.620 --> 14:21.270
<b>Lightly salted
</b>Baked, not fried

14:20.100 --> 14:21.880
They have them!

14:21.400 --> 14:21.880
Nori Balls

14:21.400 --> 14:21.880
<b>Lightly salted
</b>Baked, not fried

14:21.650 --> 14:21.880
Crispy

14:21.880 --> 14:25.470
Sota said he likes these,
 so I wanted to try them.

14:25.470 --> 14:26.510
Huh.

14:26.850 --> 14:28.090
I'll go check out.

14:32.890 --> 14:35.900
I-I'm so sorry. Thank you.

14:37.020 --> 14:38.200
Koyanagi-san?

14:38.200 --> 14:40.140
What? Y-You're mistaken.

14:43.190 --> 14:44.650
Sengoku...?

14:45.720 --> 14:49.250
Would you happen to be Hori's daughter?

14:49.250 --> 14:51.910
Oh, you're Sengoku-kun's father!

14:51.910 --> 14:55.490
Kakeru-kun is always such a help to us.

14:55.960 --> 14:57.350
Kind of you to say.

14:58.500 --> 15:00.430
You're the president's father?

15:00.430 --> 15:02.420
Hello, I'm Miyamura.

15:03.080 --> 15:05.540
The council president and I have
 become good friends.

15:06.960 --> 15:10.590
What a difference! Please don't let 
the Hori family corrupt you!

15:10.590 --> 15:11.640
Huh?

15:11.640 --> 15:14.180
Um, I can hear you.

15:17.230 --> 15:20.490
The president's father seems pretty nice.

15:20.490 --> 15:22.110
They're practically identical.

15:22.110 --> 15:24.620
Think he'll look like that in a few years?

15:25.190 --> 15:27.420
By the way, who's Koyanagi-san?

15:27.420 --> 15:29.750
Oh, that's my mom's maiden name.

15:29.750 --> 15:33.940
My parents and Sengoku's father
 went to the same high school.

15:33.940 --> 15:35.250
Huh.

15:34.700 --> 15:38.200
<b>Probably goofed off</b>

15:34.700 --> 15:38.200
<b>Two years younger</b>

15:34.700 --> 15:38.200
<b>Always smiling</b>

15:34.700 --> 15:38.200
<b>Probably serious (impression)</b>

15:35.940 --> 15:38.200
<i>I wonder what things were like back then.</i>

15:38.750 --> 15:41.350
Hey, what are your parents like?

15:41.350 --> 15:42.280
My parents?

15:43.010 --> 15:44.880
Hmm, ordinary.

15:44.880 --> 15:47.580
Oh, so just like mine.

15:49.960 --> 15:52.720
Dummy! You still had half left!

16:05.760 --> 16:08.480
You guys stay quiet way too long.

16:08.870 --> 16:12.080
We're not staying quiet. 
The conversation just keeps dying.

16:12.080 --> 16:14.610
Isn't that right, Kakeru? 
He's terrible at this.

16:14.610 --> 16:15.170
Huh?

16:15.170 --> 16:19.340
That's not true. I was just reminiscing.

16:19.340 --> 16:20.820
Right, Kakeru-kun?

16:20.820 --> 16:22.510
Um, sure.

16:22.510 --> 16:25.020
You can be honest, Kakeru-kun.

16:25.020 --> 16:28.510
There you go, ignoring his opinion.

16:27.800 --> 16:28.510
<i>Get me out of here.</i>

16:28.510 --> 16:30.690
We're back! Gosh, it's cold!

16:31.010 --> 16:33.260
Hey, President! You're here!

16:33.680 --> 16:34.690
Welcome back.

16:34.690 --> 16:36.140
<i>His dad's here, too.</i>

16:36.140 --> 16:38.760
I remember you. Hurry on inside.

16:43.870 --> 16:46.660
Hey, why are you two sitting by me?

16:46.660 --> 16:48.920
You could sit over there.

16:48.920 --> 16:51.280
It's cold by the window.

16:51.640 --> 16:54.490
Now, why are you and your dad here?

16:54.490 --> 16:57.530
Your dad ran into mine 
coming home from work,

16:57.530 --> 16:59.770
and he abducted us both.

16:59.770 --> 17:02.040
You're both really good at getting abducted.

17:02.040 --> 17:05.640
The class president's so skinny, 
I feel a draft.

17:06.390 --> 17:07.540
I'm sorry.

17:07.540 --> 17:11.170
Miyamura-kun, do you live here?

17:11.170 --> 17:12.920
You walked right in.

17:12.920 --> 17:15.050
Half of the time, I suppose.

17:15.050 --> 17:18.910
He's dating Kyoko. 
Aren't they a cute couple?

17:19.300 --> 17:20.280
Is that so?

17:20.690 --> 17:24.060
Well, Kakeru has no time for such things.

17:24.060 --> 17:25.120
Huh?

17:25.120 --> 17:28.370
Kakeru doesn't need a girlfriend.

17:28.770 --> 17:30.570
It would interfere with his studies.

17:34.430 --> 17:36.210
President, what's he talking about?

17:36.210 --> 17:37.420
Are you hiding it from him?

17:37.420 --> 17:41.590
Not hiding, exactly. I just haven't 
gotten around to telling him.

17:41.590 --> 17:45.930
I was waiting for the right time,
 and I invited Remi over for Christmas...

17:45.930 --> 17:48.120
I want it to be in my room!

17:48.430 --> 17:50.870
But I ended up going to her place instead.

17:51.500 --> 17:53.340
I was surrounded by insects.

17:54.780 --> 17:57.420
So it's remained a secret ever since.

17:57.950 --> 17:58.590
Huh?

18:01.350 --> 18:06.480
<b>The "So it's a secret, is it?" face</b>

18:01.630 --> 18:04.760
President, are you cold?
The way you're shaking is concerning.

18:05.260 --> 18:06.480
Don't tell him.

18:06.480 --> 18:08.600
Huh? Tell your dad what?

18:08.600 --> 18:09.760
What's up?

18:09.760 --> 18:10.610
Tell me what?

18:13.360 --> 18:17.580
Just tell him that you've been
 dating someone for quite a while.

18:13.360 --> 18:18.860
<b>Just tell him that you've been dating someone for quite a while. You'll feel so much better.</b>

18:17.580 --> 18:18.870
You'll feel so much better.

18:17.580 --> 18:18.870
<i>A loose cannon.</i>

18:18.870 --> 18:21.800
Say, president, 
how is Ayasaki-san today?

18:21.800 --> 18:24.870
Oh, I'm sorry! You're keeping her
 a secret, right? That just slipped out.

18:23.030 --> 18:24.870
<i>And an oblivious time bomb.</i>

18:25.200 --> 18:27.580
The oblivious time bomb is the real danger...

18:27.580 --> 18:28.430
Namely, you!

18:28.430 --> 18:30.380
Huh? I'm a person!

18:30.380 --> 18:34.240
Kakeru-kun probably has someone he's into.

18:34.240 --> 18:37.290
Isn't it unreasonable to say he can't date?

18:37.290 --> 18:39.880
<i>This could work!
Maybe this will settle things!</i>

18:39.880 --> 18:43.390
Shut up. Enough of that.
Stay out of our family affairs.

18:43.690 --> 18:47.240
Your whole way of thinking 
is outdated. Get with it.

18:47.240 --> 18:49.660
Don't boss me around. I'm older than you!

18:49.660 --> 18:53.020
You bring me here on my personal time 
and think you can lecture me?

18:53.020 --> 18:55.710
When you forgot your lunch, 
I gave you some bread from the store!

18:55.710 --> 18:57.060
Yeah, about that!

18:57.060 --> 19:00.120
That bread cost 80 yen,
 but you asked me for 100!

19:00.120 --> 19:02.490
<i>They're not even talking about 
the same thing any more.</i>

19:00.120 --> 19:03.300
How ungrateful! I can't believe you!
Kyoko, don't be like this when you grow up!

19:02.490 --> 19:04.370
<i>It almost seems...</i>

19:03.300 --> 19:06.410
Did you hear that, Kakeru?
This is fraud, plain and simple!

19:04.370 --> 19:06.410
<i>Instead of adults, they're fighting like...</i>

19:07.300 --> 19:09.210
<i>High schoolers.</i>

19:09.710 --> 19:11.340
Are you sure that's a good idea?

19:11.340 --> 19:15.400
Walking through what looks like a rain puddle
can get you soaked up to your knees.

19:15.400 --> 19:16.810
Are you sure that's a good idea?

19:16.810 --> 19:18.170
You already said that!

19:18.170 --> 19:22.090
Although, compared to the idiot who arrived 
at school <i>after</i> all the exams were over...

19:22.090 --> 19:25.100
That was only because 
someone stole my front wheel!

19:25.100 --> 19:26.680
Then walk instead!

19:26.930 --> 19:29.620
This is embarrassing. I wish they'd shut up.

19:26.930 --> 19:30.190
<b>YAMMER YAMMER</b>

19:29.620 --> 19:32.520
Yeah? It's always like this here.

19:33.070 --> 19:36.320
You two are such good friends.

19:37.420 --> 19:39.470
Yup! We're best friends, right, Sengoku?

19:39.470 --> 19:41.360
Shut up! Best friends, my ass!

19:41.360 --> 19:44.320
I'll never forgive 
what you did at graduation!

19:44.320 --> 19:47.910
Just as I was giving my 
speech as council president...

19:44.320 --> 19:48.600
Speech

19:47.910 --> 19:49.060
Achoo!

19:49.060 --> 19:51.580
You had that sneeze planned, didn't you?!

19:51.950 --> 19:54.920
That sneeze... came from 
the student body rep.

19:54.920 --> 19:56.590
We didn't have a student body rep!

19:56.590 --> 19:59.840
Let's go back to talking 
about Sengoku's girlfriend.

19:59.840 --> 20:02.090
<b><i>SHOCK</i></b>

19:59.840 --> 20:04.320
No! Feel free to keep reminiscing!

20:04.320 --> 20:06.660
Don't try to laugh it off!

20:06.660 --> 20:10.100
<i>It seems that the Sengokus...</i>

20:10.680 --> 20:13.250
<i>are still at the mercy of the Horis.</i>

20:19.020 --> 20:23.110
Listen, Kakeru. You do not 
need a girlfriend right now.

20:23.110 --> 20:26.200
Especially not one like Hori's daughter.

20:26.200 --> 20:28.120
<i>There's no way I can tell him now!</i>

20:30.200 --> 20:35.150
Imports are stuff that comes into Japan...

20:36.120 --> 20:38.770
I hope I can score at least 40 on this.

20:38.770 --> 20:41.630
Can I get that high? I'm not so sure.

20:42.170 --> 20:43.320
Did you study for math?

20:43.320 --> 20:45.040
I gave up.

20:45.040 --> 20:47.640
You gave up at the beginning
 of the school year.

20:48.150 --> 20:50.050
Try picking it back up instead.

20:52.120 --> 20:53.140
You're eating so many.

20:53.840 --> 20:55.780
Your nails will turn orange.

20:55.780 --> 20:57.650
I'm not eating <i>that</i> many.

20:59.820 --> 21:01.150
Don't say I didn't warn you.

21:04.080 --> 21:04.810
Here.

21:04.810 --> 21:07.910
Me eating won't do anything
 about your fingers.

21:09.360 --> 21:10.870
I know.

21:20.650 --> 21:21.760
<i>This is like...</i>

21:22.410 --> 21:24.920
<i>feeding an animal! I'll give him another.</i>

21:52.150 --> 21:53.990
I cleaned your finger.

21:58.460 --> 22:00.960
<b>Drip</b>

22:00.960 --> 22:03.130
It's not clean.

22:04.460 --> 22:07.710
Hori-san, I'll skip everything
 except classic lit.

22:07.710 --> 22:09.140
Huh?!

23:36.320 --> 23:40.320
Next time
page.5 Iura
